"You can use §0 or §1 either on §2 to split it up into components or directly "
"on its component in §3. Be careful to use the syntax that is appropriate for "
"terms of product or coproduct types, respectively."
msgstr ""
"Вы можете использовать §0 или §1 либо на §2, чтобы разбить его на "
