"The goal in this level is to define composition as a multivariable function "
"between function types §11.\n"
"\n"
"We often think of composition as the function that takes §12 and §13 to the "
"composite function §14.\n"
"\n"
"But it can also be thought of as a function that takes §15, §16, and §17 to "
