#: Game.Levels.NaturalNumbersWorld.L05_PredecessorOfSuccessor
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"In the previous level you defined the function §0 by recursion and proved "
"that it satisfies the properties:\n"
"\n"
"* §1 and\n"
"* §2.\n"
"\n"
"In this level you are asked to check a closely related property: namely "
